SUMMARY:Panigiri of Panagia Faneromeni\, Ano Archanes
LOCATION:Ano Archanes\, Crete (Heraklion)\, Greece
DESCRIPTION:Archanes keeps the Dormition at its church of Panagia Faneromeni: festive vespers with a Byzantine choir and artoklasia on the 14th\, liturgy from 7 am on the 15th\, and a glenti in the restored village square with the local wine flowing. The village is 15 km from Heraklion with plenty of tavernas\; reserve a table for the evening of the 14th.\n\nhttps://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/heraklion/#ano-archanes-panigiri-of-panagia-faneromeni-ano-archanes
